      "cooked": "<p>Crazy Theory</p><p>Scholar is Citizen Anvil from a future timeline.</p><p>Both are about defence. Both have (typically) a yellowish glow. Both don't say much. Both look alike, mind you one out his hair in a ponytail and has a little more weight, the big difference is that he's just an older version. He settled down, and realized there's not enough time for hate, violence, and non-dude things.</p><p>Is this too far fetched?</p>",
